%% NIZAM Retention Lifecycle (Hot → Warm → Cold → Archive)
%% Source of truth: NIZAM__system/docs/NIZAM_ORCHESTRATION_LAYER.md §5 + §6.d
%% Enforced by Steward (AGENT_MAPPING.json#agents.Steward.retention_tiers)
%% Legal-hold guard: NEVER auto-delete audit/identity history.

stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Hot

    Hot: Hot 0-30d (Notion full, Drive Records/)
    Warm: Warm 30-90d (Notion compact, Drive Records/)
    Cold: Cold 90-365d (Notion summary, Drive _Archive/)
    Archive: Archive 1y+ (Notion reference, Drive _Archive/ max compression)

    Hot --> Warm: age > 30d
    Warm --> Cold: age > 90d
    Cold --> Archive: age > 365d

    state LegalHoldCheck <<choice>>
    Archive --> LegalHoldCheck: operator requests delete
    LegalHoldCheck --> Archive: HOLD active - refuse, log attempt
    LegalHoldCheck --> Restored: operator restore request
    LegalHoldCheck --> Deleted: operator confirm + no legal hold

    Restored --> Hot: rehydrate to Hot tier
    Deleted --> [*]

    note right of Hot
        Trigger: record created (write-receipt OK).
        Indexed: dedupe_key in Notion, file in Drive Records/{Lane}/.
    end note

    note right of Cold
        Trigger: nightly Steward sweep (cf. SCHEDULED_AGENTS.md).
        Action: Notion compact-then-link, Drive .docx -> .zip in _Archive/.
    end note

    note right of LegalHoldCheck
        Audit Log + identity history are ALWAYS held.
        No auto-delete EVER without operator confirm + legal-hold check.
    end note
